								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1011"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13919#msg13919"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13919#msg13919">Re: New Bitch Topic from Top Ten List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> January 25, 2005, 12:35:40 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I have been reading this post and even though i am not in a Uber guild nor will i ever see time i still feel the need to express what i see going on.<br />RoS was suppose to be in time on friday and ascent took there day away from them, i see everyone saying To bad we took your day, why couldnt anyone in ascent maybe an officer get intouch with an officer in RoS and ask them if they can do time on friday? What does ascent have to have we dont care attitude when it comes to mobs?<br />I am not taken sides here but this could of all been avoided if there was some kind of communication between the 2 guilds.<br />Not to mention friday is only 1 day ascent had 6 other days to pick from what i am guessing, i also see that ascent also did this to conviction?<br />I have has many friends in the Old ascent, and they are long gone so there is no one that i can talk to in that guild to find out what is going on.<br /><br />As far as warping i dont know what that means lol, but i am guessing its bad<br /><br />Anyway just a suggestion you guys in the top end of the game try to communicate more often and maybe you wont see rants and name calling like this<br /><br />just a suggestion dont flame me&nbsp; <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/dissappointed.gif" alt="dissappointed" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
