							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1386.msg13907#msg13907">Quote from: Ssnakess on January 25, 2005, 05:34:35 am</a></div><div class="quote">What it really seems to come down to (note I haven&#039;t played in a while) is that we, Ascent, don&#039;t give a flying fuck about your rotation.<br /></div><br />Somehow I doubt this is the attitude of everyone is Ascent. It&#039;s pretty cool that you don&#039;t mind stepping up to make everyone in the guild look like a jackass though. I&#039;m sure they appreciate that.<br /><br />And if that is the attitude of everyone in Ascent, it&#039;ll make for some good drama at least and it will be funny to see it eventually bite you in the ass. If you don&#039;t think continuous negative actions will eventually have a negative effect, you are sorely mistaken.
