							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Grem answer me this .. when Time was being farmed consistently when did Ascent raid time .. what day was it?<br /><br />I seem to remember it being friday and the alliance on sunday so as for your rotation RoS has been raiding time on Ascent&#039;s day also as for stepping in on Conviction you all had Tuesday if time had been cleared on Monday if not then wednesday and Thursday were your days and everyone then respected that is Ascent wanted Time on Friday it was theres so basically non of you have shit to bitch about.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
