							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							actually they DO matter. <br /><br />I have read your post 4 times and I&#039;m still not completely sure what your trying to say. <br /><br />allIcanseeiswordsandsentecesrunningtogetherandtheydontmakeanysense <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /><br /><br />But really I don&#039;t see the problem, Ass-scent got there 1st. they win.&nbsp; It&#039;s not like there isn&#039;t any other choice for targets. I&#039;m sure RoS has raided (and could have radied) some OOW or GoD targets.
