							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Actually Laylina, any time that somebody wanted to raid PoTime on Forsakens days, asked. Everybody in guild bitched, but Thoerax and Rogosh were contacted about it. Maybe I missed a day or 2, but any time it happened when I was on, Forsaken was asked =). Hell, Ascent even asked if they could have one of the days.
